                    Cloudflare resource programmatically from your existing workflows.
                  </CardDescription>
                </CardContent>
              </Card>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="component-example-code">
        <CodeBlock code={sourceCode} lang="astro" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Installation */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Installation</Heading>
    <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-kumo-strong">
      Marketing is a <strong>block</strong> — a full-page layout template you copy into your project and own. Unlike components, blocks are not imported from a package. You get the full source code and can customize it however you need.
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>1. Install dependencies</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={installCode} lang="bash" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>2. Copy the source code into your page</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={`# Copy the source code above into your page, e.g.:
src/pages/features.astro`} lang="bash" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>3. Update feature content and copy</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={`<!-- Update each feature card's title, description, and icon to match your product -->`} lang="astro" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Usage */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Usage</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">
      Drop the features grid as a <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">&lt;section&gt;</code> anywhere in your marketing page. Swap the section label, heading, description, and individual feature cards for your own content.
    </p>
    <CodeBlock code={usageCode} lang="astro" />
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Examples */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Examples</Heading>

    <Heading level={3}>CTA Banner</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">A full-width call-to-action banner with an inverted dark background. Pair it below the features grid to drive conversions.</p>

    <div class="not-prose overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
      <div class="rounded-t-lg border border-kumo-hairline bg-kumo-contrast">
        <div class="py-20 px-8">
          <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-kumo-inverse tracking-tight text-pretty">
              Ready to build on the edge?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-base text-kumo-inverse/70 text-pretty">
              Join millions of developers who trust Cloudflare to deliver fast, secure,
              and reliable applications — from side projects to enterprise scale.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
              <Button variant="primary">Start for free</Button>
              <Button variant="secondary">Talk to sales</Button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="component-example-code">
        <CodeBlock code={ctaBannerCode} lang="astro" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <Heading level={3} class="mt-8">Testimonial</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">A centered customer quote with an avatar and attribution. Use it to build social proof alongside your feature highlights.</p>

    <ComponentExample code={testimonialCode} lang="astro">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-full min-h-[320px] py-16 px-8">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-8">
          <blockquote>
            <p class="text-xl text-kumo-default leading-relaxed text-pretty">
              "Cloudflare Workers cut our API latency by 80%. We now deploy to 330+ locations
              with a single command and never think about infrastructure again."
            </p>
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-kumo-brand flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-kumo-inverse">JL</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-kumo-default text-sm">Jamie Lee</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle">VP Engineering, Acme Corp</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </ComponentExample>

  </ComponentSection>

  {/* API Reference */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>API Reference</Heading>
    <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Component</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Package</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Purpose</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="text-kumo-strong">
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">Card</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">@cloudflare/kumo-astro</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">Container for each feature item</td>
